{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_01_end","storyGroup":"act42side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act42side_level_act42side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"MT-1","storyName":"圣秩","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"刚刚在城内制造了爆炸的能天使进入一辆告解车，与车载电子告解师共同确认了拉特兰的异常之处，并谋划炸毁育婴圣堂，阻止万国峰会的最后一项重要活动——降生仪式。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act42side/level_act42side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act42side_01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["蕾缪安","七厅调查员","？？？","阿摩斯","费德里科","里凯莱","机械提示音","自律告解车","能天使","忙碌的修女","阿尔图罗","席德佳"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_bg_26_g11_laterano_alley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"几个路口都查过了吗？","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_366_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"七厅调查员","text":"嗯，并未发现可疑人员。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_366_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"七厅调查员","text":"我们也在附近询问了可能目击到异常的公民，没什么有价值的线索。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_366_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"天气太潮湿的话，柱子上可能会长蘑菇，但再怎么样都不会自己长炸弹的，对吧？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_366_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"七厅调查员","text":"但......怎么可能？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_366_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"七厅调查员","text":"除非是教皇厅或育婴圣堂的公职人员，否则持有任何爆炸物，都意味着要受到公证所的实时监督。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_366_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"七厅调查员","text":"别说爆炸，拉特兰都多少年没出现过一声计划之外的铳响了？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_366_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-20","duration":"1.5","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#5$2","focus":"none","id":28},{"type":"text","text":"蕾缪安蹲下身子，从已经半毁的石柱里取出了一块炸弹的碎片。","id":29},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-20","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"结构很精巧......这种类型的炸弹，如果填装的是常规爆破物，受损的不可能只有这根柱子。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_366_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"七厅调查员","text":"您是说......自制的？为了什么，恶作剧？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_366_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"拉特兰热武装管控名录是由教皇厅最资深的爆破专家编撰的，几乎所有能产生有效爆炸的材料都被考虑进去了。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"要用名录之外的材料拼凑出这样一枚炸弹，恐怕要费上不少力气。没人会为一时兴起的恶作剧做到这个地步。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"更何况，现在正值第二届万国峰会，如此特殊的时间点......","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#11$2","focus":"none","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"蕾缪安又想起了那一抹红色，她有些不安，但更多的是疑惑。","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"将约维塔街，不，整个司提望区近期人口流动的相关文件给我看看。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_366_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"七厅调查员","text":"......","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_366_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"怎么了？","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"这些明显派得上用场的资料，在我们得到命令的同时，就应该有人负责及时调取才对啊。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"none","id":54},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"在这里在这里！","id":56},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.4","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（捶胸）呼——呼——","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"实在是抱歉，蕾缪安枢机，这是您刚刚要的资料。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"我是第七厅调查员阿摩斯，今后将担任您的枢机辅佐官。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"你迟到了，阿摩斯辅佐官。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"按照帕特里奇昂阁下的说法，你会在我到达现场后的十分钟内赶来增援......但现在已经过去将近半小时了。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"抱歉抱歉，我本来在准备欢迎会的茶点。我以为事情没那么急......","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"（嘘——）","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"第七厅既然委派你当我的辅佐官，你应该对我有所耳闻吧？","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"噤、噤声的蕾缪安......","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"工作的时候，别说任何借口。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"charslot","id":85},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_bg_26_g9_laterano_street.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":87},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":88,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"费德里科，吃冰淇淋吗？我请你。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"我在执行任务的过程中没有食用甜品的习惯。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B5/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"以及，在离开公证所前，我已经吃过了。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"原来休息室最后那点存货是你小子吃光的......","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"看在我发现了这个秘密的分上，你应该告诉我，你突然从公证所跑出来，究竟要做什么？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"你已经在这里站了十分钟了，但这个路口明明什么都没有。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"我没有向同僚同步私人事务的义务。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"你刚刚还说自己在“执行任务”......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2C/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#2$1","focus":"none","id":113},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hastybell","volume":"1","id":114},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":116},{"type":"multiline","name":"里凯莱","text":"这个声音......","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":118},{"type":"multiline","name":"里凯莱","end":"true","text":"哦哦哦——你在等告解车！","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"费德里科，虽然作为公证所投诉率最高的执行者，你确实累积了不少“罪恶”，但你想要主动忏悔还是太稀奇了......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"给你。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"r","id":128},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"嗯？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"之前报销萨尔贡外勤任务的费用时，把买黄金之城文化盲盒的花销也算进去了，导致报销的钱比实际任务开支多了一倍......","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"我满怀愧疚地出门......当时正好有一辆告解车从面前经过，我就......顺便办了张年卡，给你用吧。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"机械提示音","text":"到站通知。","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"机械提示音","text":"自律告解车，编号“ELCARO-001”，即将到达，请有告解需求的公民排队等候。","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"机械提示音","text":"“主愿每一位迷途之人获得救赎。”","id":140},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hastybell","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":143},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bicyclegallop","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4188_confes_1#2$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"false","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"3.5","isblock":"true","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4188_confes_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"自律告解车","text":"——","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_4188_confes_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4188_confes_1#2$1","focus":"none","id":150},{"type":"text","text":"告解车缓缓进入两人的视野，费德里科伸出手去。","id":151},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hastybell","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":155},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bicyclegallop","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"false","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"2.5","isblock":"true","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":159},{"type":"charslot","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#9$1","duration":"1.5","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#10$1","duration":"1.5","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"费德里科，连机器人都知道你没情感方面的需求......","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"几乎所有拉特兰人在日常生活中都会接触告解车，某种程度上，这些机器处理的数据比公证所的资料更加多元且详实。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"它们是天然的案卷，异常在其中显形。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费德里科","text":"......我已经得出了一些结论。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1032_excu2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.4","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"false","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"2.5","isblock":"true","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_372_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里凯莱","text":"唔......等等，费德里科，不告诉我是什么结论也没关系，但你究竟在查什么？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.4","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","isblock":"false","id":183},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"2.5","isblock":"true","id":184},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":185},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"charslot","id":188},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_bg_26_g11_laterano_alley.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":190},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":192},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hastybell","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bicyclegallop","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4188_confes_1#2$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"false","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"3.5","isblock":"true","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"none","id":198},{"type":"text","text":"凡怀信仰者，自省即为功课。放眼整个圣城，作为教堂的延伸，告解车的数量可能只略少于甜品车。","id":199},{"type":"text","text":"这种移动公共设施在拉特兰的大街小巷里穿行，让每一位拉特兰公民的情绪能在第一时间得到纾解。","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"在那小小的隐秘的空间里，面对圣像、面对铳械、面对美妙的音乐，你可以向车载电子告解师尽情地倾诉一切——","id":201},{"type":"text","text":"小到摄入过量糖分的羞耻，大到背叛同胞、戕害族类的罪恶。","id":202},{"type":"text","text":"拒载了费德里科的自律告解车“ELCARO-001”在巷子深处停下。随后它打开了门，神秘的客人闪身进来。","id":203},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":207},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_61_i03_1.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":212},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_formal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":213,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“你来迟了，能天使。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":218},{"type":"subtitle","id":219},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"不是你叮嘱我凡事小心？","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"确认完毕，我屁股后面没留尾巴，你也没给那个冷面男动手动脚的机会。","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“以他的观察力，恐怕还是注意到了我身上的异常之处。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":226},{"type":"subtitle","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我会祈祷你不被他逮住然后被拆掉的。","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“......”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":233},{"type":"subtitle","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"怎么了？","id":236},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“你换了身衣服。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":240},{"type":"subtitle","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_61_i03_4.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"穿着企鹅物流的制服在拉特兰跑，太显眼了呀。","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"这可是我当初亲自设计的礼服，就在毕业典礼上穿过一回！","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我还没说你呢！要知道......你的声音从一辆告解车的音箱里传出来，真是要多怪有多怪！","id":247},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":250},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“言归正传。实验失败了，是吗？”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":251},{"type":"subtitle","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_61_i03_3.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"哎呀，虽然不愿意承认，但——是的。","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我费了老大劲才找齐替代的材料——集市、面包房、游乐场，还有学校的秘密商店......我熟悉的渠道都找了个遍。","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"结果造出来的东西连根柱子都没炸断！稍微好用一点的材料全被管控起来了，问谁谁都说不出理由。","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"总不至于是为了最近的那场万国峰会吧？","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"如果拉特兰居然有人觉得一场美丽又动听的爆炸会对万国峰会产生什么威胁，那一定不是我有问题，是拉特兰有问题！","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"至于万国峰会......他们刚公布了峰会的最后一项活动——在那座圣堂里举行一场“降生仪式”。","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"造了一座夸张到全城上下都能看见的建筑，居然不是用来当甜品博物馆，而是在里面当众展示生孩子？！","id":262},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“你如愿亲自验证了家乡的异样。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":266},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“如你所见，这的确不是你所熟知的拉特兰。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":267},{"type":"subtitle","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_61_i03_5.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"嘿嘿，我也不能什么都信你嘛，毕竟，你现在只是一位“车载电子告解师”。","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"不过现在我确实信了。","id":273},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_61_i03_1.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"拉特兰......肯定发生了一些很了不得的变化。最要命的是，其他人完全不觉得有什么问题！","id":277},{"type":"dialog","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":280},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“那座圣堂，那场仪式。如果所有异样都指向它们......”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":281},{"type":"subtitle","id":282},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":283},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_61_i03_2.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"那我们就该想点办法破坏它们，对吧？","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"要是我真研究明白了怎么拿厨房材料拼凑成的炸弹炸翻那么大一座圣堂，拉特兰所有的大学是不是该联合起来给我颁个终身成就奖？","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“只要你能重新唤起他们对爆炸的热爱。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":291},{"type":"subtitle","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_61_i03_5.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"拉特兰人对爆炸的热爱居然需要专门唤醒，听起来像在做梦。明明只需要扔进铳械工坊待一下午就好了。","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"对哦，铳械工坊！工坊关停归关停，里面的人又没丢！","id":297},{"type":"dialog","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":300},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“等等，能天使。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":301},{"type":"subtitle","id":302},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0A/Avg_61_i03_6.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"我知道你要说什么，一旦出了事，铳械工坊是最容易被查到的地方，太危险了，对吧？","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"放心，我会万事小心的。你也千万别被人拆了，等事情结束我亲自拆你。","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“......”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":311},{"type":"subtitle","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":314},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_61_i03_4.png","block":"false","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"能天使","text":"不管怎么说......欢迎来到拉特兰！","id":317},{"type":"dialog","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":319},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"charslot","id":323},{"type":"image","id":324},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4E/Avg_bg_26_g10_laterano_roof.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":325},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":326},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":327,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":329},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"调查已经结束，辛苦啦，各位。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"在记录上签字确认后，就可以返回第七厅了。如果欢迎会的茶点还没有凉透，可以请大家一起帮我消灭它们吗？","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"啊对了，阿摩斯辅佐官，你得陪我去见一趟铳骑。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"我......","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"有什么问题吗？","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"如果您说的铳骑是指帕特里奇昂阁下，我......我让约里尔陪您去吧。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"理由？","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"......","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"十多年前，一座移动修道院在押送犯人返回拉特兰的途中发生了骚乱，一位铳骑与她的同僚爆发了激烈的冲突......","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"等到教皇厅派去的人赶到时，现场已经死伤惨重，那位铳骑也已堕天。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"后来，她被驱逐出了拉特兰，从此音讯全无。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我听说过这个案子。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"那位铳骑正是我的妻子，而率队赶去善后，最后将她放逐的，正是帕特里奇昂阁下。","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"阿摩斯辅佐官，你待在第七厅的时间远比我久，应该不需要重新了解我们与铳骑的职责所在——","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"啊不不，您误会了。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"那件事情，完完全全就是我妻子的错。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"每一个对着同胞举起守护铳的萨科塔，都该受律法的裁决，被逐出乐园。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"我没有任何立场怪罪帕特里奇昂阁下......我只是，没法说服自己就这么见他。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"之前遇到需要和铳骑对接的情况，你也是这样处理的吗？","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"我......抱歉，是。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5B/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"......唉。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"非常抱歉！您给我五分钟，我整理一下情绪，或许还是可以与您同去......","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我不是在怪罪你。我只是在想，第七厅的工作就是这样。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"总是见到不想见的人，见不到想见的人，或者更糟——以不喜欢的方式见到想见的人。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"我可是很讨厌以上级的口吻对莫斯提马她们交代工作的。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"可他们都说，您是主动提出要进入第七厅工作的......","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"因为在这个位置上，有很多我能做到的事呀。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"你也一样，阿摩斯。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1783_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿摩斯","text":"谢谢您。但我确实是个没什么追求的人，我妻子还在的时候是这样，她离开之后更是这样......","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_npc_1783_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"七厅倒是还有很多事需要你做。比如，如果我没记错的话，法柏尔区还有几座铳械工坊需要人手去处理？","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"这可是当下的头等要务，铳械工坊的接收工作没有纰漏，才不会再出现像今天这样的爆炸案。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1811_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蕾缪安","text":"交给你了，快去快回，好吗？","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1811_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":391},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_bg_31_g3_mini12_farmland.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":397},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":398,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":400},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkmeadow","volume":"1","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_370_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"累了吗？","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_370_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"从清晨到现在，您已经割了六垄麦子了，要不去草垛边休息一会儿吧......","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_370_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"阿尔图罗小姐。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_370_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":407},{"type":"charslot","id":408},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":409},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"没关系，我的体力没那么差。更何况......","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_370_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忙碌的修女","text":"更何况？","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_370_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"没什么。我只是忍不住想要看看，这片田野的边际在哪里。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"它似乎望不到尽头，连我的琴声也无法穿越它。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":418},{"type":"charslot","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那您可得再加把劲了！","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkmeadow","volume":"1","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"又见面了，席德佳修女。","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"午安，阿尔图罗小姐。","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我是来送午饭的——面包、冰淇淋饼干，搭配一大杯精酿啤酒！","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"谢谢。您刚刚说，加把劲？","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我是说，咱们还有的忙呢。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"看看这些金黄的麦穗和层层的麦浪......拉特兰迎来了又一个丰收的好年成啊。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BB/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"除去我们自己的口粮，兰登修道院今年估计能匀出以往两倍的粮食用来制作瘤奶面包和精酿啤酒，到时候又能多一大笔收入！","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"......","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"您笑什么？","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"你们聊起生活的样子，让我越来越喜欢这个监狱了，席德佳修女。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"您对这个监狱的尊重，也让我越来越喜欢您了，阿尔图罗小姐。","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我有点好奇，您到底犯下了怎样的过错？我听其他修女说，您的琴声很动人，也很危险。","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"我有一个问题。","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"如果没记错的话，兰登修道院设立的初衷，是为了保护教宗以及拉特兰教会的重要神职人员......","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"我也有点好奇，这里是从什么时候开始行使“监狱”职能的呢？","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"对一些身份特殊的人员进行监管，不也正是为了保护......呃，重要的神职人员，为了戍卫拉特兰的安宁？","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"从始至终，兰登修道院的意义都不曾变过。","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"而且，对圣城越重要，修道院就离破产越远。","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"唔......","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"身为一位黎博利，您居然这么快地适应了这里？","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FA/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"啊，什么意思？","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"我就是在这里长大的啊。","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"......原来如此。","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"哦，我差点忘了，这是您昨天托我借来的东西。","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"谢谢。","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1784_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"席德佳","text":"阿尔图罗小姐，您为什么突然想要读《圣徒行记》？","id":470,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_npc_1784_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":471},{"type":"charslot","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":473},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":475},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#10$1","focus":"none","id":477},{"type":"text","text":"阿尔图罗望向远方。","id":478},{"type":"text","text":"她的身后是略显残破的修道院，身前是灿烂的金黄色麦浪。麦田与圣城的边缘相连，又似乎延伸向无限远的远方，没有尽头。","id":479},{"type":"text","text":"风吹过麦浪，没有惊起多余的声响，拉特兰像是安静地沉睡着。","id":480},{"type":"dialog","id":481},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_245_cello_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":482},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿尔图罗","text":"......一个囚徒，当然是为了告解。","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_245_cello_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":485},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":486},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":487},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":488},{"type":"image","id":489},{"type":"charslot","id":490}],"characters":["蕾缪安","七厅调查员","？？？","阿摩斯","费德里科","里凯莱","机械提示音","自律告解车","能天使","忙碌的修女","阿尔图罗","席德佳"]}